OL,3,GNEWSAFamily react after inquest into
OL,4,Aboy's window jump
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe parents of a five-year-old boy who
OL,7,Fdied after jumping from a 15th-floor
OL,8,Ftower block window in east London say
OL,9,Fthey hope other families can be spared
OL,10,Fthe "devastation" they have faced.
OL,12,FAalim Ahmed died instantly when he fell
OL,13,Ffrom a kitchen window, which could tilt
OL,14,Fand turn, at a residential block in
OL,15,FPlaistow on 16 May 2024.
OL,17,FHis parents Makail Ahmed and Sahra
OL,18,FOsman have responded after a narrative
OL,19,Fconclusion was delivered at their son's
OL,20,Finquest on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,324,320,200,140,0,100
