OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSAFamily react after inquest into
OL,4,Aboy's window jump
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe coroner said Aalim possibly leapt
OL,7,Fin the belief he could fly, and while
OL,8,Fthe window was "compromised", there was
OL,9,F"no compelling reason" a landlord
OL,10,Fshould have deemed placing him on the
OL,11,F15th floor inappropriate.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
